config CLOCK_CONTROL_TELINK_B87
	bool "Telink TLSR8278 module clock driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TELINK_B87_CLOCK_ENABLED
	help
	  Turns the module clocks of the clock enable registers 0x63-0x65 on
	  and off (DS-TLSR8278 4.3) and gives their rate, the system clock as
	  the clock select registers 0x66 and 0x70 set it (4.2). The SoC
	  setup turns every module clock but the TRNG's on at boot.
